WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:00:06.650 --> 00:00:12.610
The furious rain, Makes my heart shake
hageshii ame ga, kokoro wo yuruwaseru

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.820
Like it did on that day
Ano hi no youni

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:22.910
But I just ran through, In my dream I had till yesterday
Tada hashirinuketa, kinou made no MY DREAM

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:26.710
...I still believe
...shinjiteiru no sa

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:34.470
I'm willing to fight, An endless defense
Owari no nai, defense demo ii yo

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:42.350
As long as you, Keep on gazing at me
Kimi ga boku wo, mitsumetsuzukete kureru nara

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.270
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:50.980
Turn to face all the mornings ahead, And someday
Ikutsumono asa wo mukae, Itsuka kitto

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.860
Try to seize them
tsukande miseru

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:56.450
STAND UP TO THE VICTORY!

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:02.120
Even if nothing, Lies on the other side
Sono mukougawa ni, nanimonakutemo

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:06.040
It doesn't matter to me
kamawanai kara

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:14.050
...Just as long as I can embrace, Your gentle, irreplaceable smile!
Kakegae no nai, kimi no yasashii egao daite

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:30.330
Üso Ewin, surrounded by enemies, witnesses the fate of the adult Garry Tunn,

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:34.230
and comes to fear that the battlefield is a place that drives men mad.

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:38.800
Or rather, he begins to suspect...

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:42.200
...that it is people's stubbornness that creates the battlefield.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:45.260
But, Üso...

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:47.900
A WARRIOR'S BRILLIANCE

00:01:47.900 --> 00:01:49.630
"A Warrior's Brilliance".

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:50.130
A WARRIOR'S BRILLIANCE

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:52.760
Scared... I'm scared!

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:56.430
But I'm afraid of just sitting there and waiting to die even more!

00:01:56.630 --> 00:01:57.430
Why, you!

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:02.200
It's a support fighter with no firepower!

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:04.230
He should run while he can!

00:02:06.430 --> 00:02:08.930
The pilot's an amateur! And he's scared!

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.130
How could that thing have gotten both Garry and Sabat?!

00:02:12.160 --> 00:02:14.100
They probably got careless!

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:22.960
W-What's that formation?

00:02:23.230 --> 00:02:26.160
I'll show you just what being a soldier means!

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.200
Three against one? He'll never win!

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:36.500
The west catapult's destroyed! This is the only Hanger we can launch!

00:02:36.530 --> 00:02:37.160
What about the Boots?

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:38.600
We still have two or three.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:41.130
All right! Give Üso whatever support that you can!

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.760
Üso, don't get hit!

00:02:51.460 --> 00:02:53.130
We've still got some alive down there!

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.060
Are you okay?

00:03:04.100 --> 00:03:05.100
Y-Yeah.

00:03:05.260 --> 00:03:06.700
Take care of that leg.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.000
Üso, why do you have to fight?

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:20.530
I... I...

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:26.260
I don't want Miss Katejina or Miss Marbet or anyone else here to die!

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:30.830
That kid's got this all wrong.

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.730
Miss Katejina, can you hear me?

00:03:33.930 --> 00:03:36.100
If you waste shots, you'll run out of ammo!

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.400
Understood!

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.300
Move the crane left!

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.860
Don't just say "move it!"

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:42.760
Give me a clock face direction!

00:03:42.800 --> 00:03:44.230
Um, 10 o'clock!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:45.430
Roger!

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:51.200
I don't want you getting killed either, Üso.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:54.460
Way too late! I've lost sight of them!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:55.200
Oh!

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:56.600
Of course you did!

00:03:56.630 --> 00:04:01.030
Next time they fly in front of where we're aiming, shoot!

00:04:05.960 --> 00:04:09.600
Where are they planning to move the white one's parts?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.160
Need any help?

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.360
Move the Camion forward a bit!

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:16.430
Roger!

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:23.060
Isn't there some way I can take these back as spoils of war?

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:28.130
If they could just stop bombing us...

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.130
Although I'm interested in seeing the combat techniques...

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:34.660
...of the infamous Wattary Gilla combat team.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.160
Come on, hurry up with the Hanger!

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.230
All right! Go!

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:49.300
Its armaments are stronger once it's docked!

00:04:55.600 --> 00:04:57.030
We're launching the Boots, next!

00:04:57.060 --> 00:04:58.300
Huh? What?

00:04:58.330 --> 00:04:59.330
Here come the Boots!

00:05:02.730 --> 00:05:04.430
Another piece?!

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:11.260
How dare you attack it like that!

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:16.860
What?!

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:30.630
Üso!

00:05:32.630 --> 00:05:35.060
Can't you come back, Üso?

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:47.560
Is he getting caught up in this war?

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:51.200
Is the war taking Üso away?

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.930
Odelo, set up the Boots on the Camion.

00:06:01.960 --> 00:06:02.900
Yes, sir!

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.660
Üso! Can you hear me?

00:06:05.700 --> 00:06:07.400
We're sending out another Boots to you!

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.630
Just hang on a little longer! Do you read me?

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.800
Alright, easy, alright.

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:24.760
Count!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.130
The enemy has infiltrated us!

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:35.930
Striker!

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:40.630
I won't let you dock it again!

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:43.530
As I thought!

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.330
Get down!

00:06:50.900 --> 00:06:51.730
You!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:06:59.930
Odelo!

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.530
Don't! Don't make a move on him!

00:07:02.960 --> 00:07:03.730
Don't move!

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:07.430
Anyone moves, and I'll shoot these two.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.460
Don't make me do that!

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.360
Who are you?

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:14.730
Count Oi Nyung, you're coming with me.

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.430
One of BESPA's Yellow Jackets?! I won't do as you say!

00:07:19.730 --> 00:07:21.700
You're a Yellow Jacket?

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.800
Can you drive a wappa?

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:26.300
Come with me.

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.200
No! Shoot this man!

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.060
There's a gun on the ground. Want to go for it?

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:49.530
I beg your pardon.

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:54.100
Don't think, just do as I say.

00:08:01.830 --> 00:08:04.360
L-Lieutenant, help me, please!

00:08:04.730 --> 00:08:05.900
Just hang on!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:10.960
It's fast!

00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.600
Bacoo!

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:26.230
He got me! I can't maintain flight!

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:27.700
Do something, please!

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:33.000
Bacoo! Abandon the mobile suit! Bail out!

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:38.360
Bacoo, stop!

00:08:39.930 --> 00:08:41.500
Agh! Here it comes!

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:44.260
A soldier who fears death is useless!

00:08:47.300 --> 00:08:48.430
Captain!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.360
You know the penalty for showing fear, Bacoo!

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:12.130
BESPA... They even kill their own?

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:23.530
Okay, plant the outriggers!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.460
Üso! Üso, do you read me?

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.530
No good...

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.060
Miss Marbet, do you read me?

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:30.930
We're launching the Boots! Cover it!

00:09:30.960 --> 00:09:32.460
I'm sending it out, Old Man!

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.460
Do it!

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.800
Please, dock successfully!

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:46.400
There's another leg segment?

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.760
Lining up for V Mode!

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.800
Docking, complete!

00:10:13.030 --> 00:10:14.960
The white mobile suit!

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.360
I, Wattary Gilla,

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:20.830
will smash the legendary symbol of resistance they called Gundam!

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:36.700
We're the ones rebelling against the Earth Federation!

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:39.930
A true Gundam would be on our side!

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.430
I have you!

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:13.160
I should be able to get him! Go!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:22.400
Dammit, Trump! Why's your rotor output dropping?!

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:24.230
It was that white monster!

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:28.030
No! We were fools to look down on their weapons development.

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:29.900
Trump, follow me!

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:30.760
Roger!

00:11:40.530 --> 00:11:43.960
That's it! Yeah! Just go away!

00:11:50.030 --> 00:11:52.800
Thanks. It feels better now.

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:57.930
Lieutenant, I keep telling you, I'm of no use to you.

00:11:57.960 --> 00:11:59.960
That's for me to decide.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:06.960
They're retreating?

00:12:07.400 --> 00:12:09.630
Girl, follow those mobile suits.

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.200
My name is Katejina Loos.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.700
Is it? Forgive me.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:16.500
Now I know your name.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.730
Just go, and you'll be all right.

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:25.330
I brought you some water.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.230
Here, have some water.

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:29.300
Thanks, I appreciate it.

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:31.960
Um, th-thanks.

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:33.900
Welcome back, Üso.

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.430
Here. Nice job.

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.300
Thanks.

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:43.430
Shahkti, are you okay?

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.230
What's wrong?

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:50.430
Good job.

00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.400
It's Count Nyung.

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.030
Was the count killed?

00:12:56.160 --> 00:12:58.400
No, but he may as well have been.

00:12:58.430 --> 00:13:01.130
He was taken by a BESPA spy.

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:02.530
Taken?

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.160
Along with your beloved Katejina.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:07.430
Miss Katejina, too? What do you mean?!

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:08.900
I just told you.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.060
How did it happen?!

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.760
We were careless.

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:19.460
No... No, this can't have happened...

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:32.530
That mobile suit team they sent may have just been a feint.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:34.730
To kidnap the count?

00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:35.460
Yeah.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.030
Then, I was tricked?

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:41.230
It means you didn't actually win.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:43.000
What does that mean?!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.760
Exactly what I said!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.560
Then why didn't you protect them?!

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.260
We did our best!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:49.530
Then you should have stopped it!

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:50.730
It's not that simple!

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:51.700
Here we go!

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:52.360
You...

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:54.860
What was the point of me even fighting?!

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:57.830
You weren't the only one who was fighting!

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:00.800
You two fighting isn't going to help anything!

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.960
You're fighting the wrong person!

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.530
Üso, this isn't like you.

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:08.530
You conceited...

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.860
If we stay here, we'll all end up going crazy.

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:51.500
I'll go back to Kasarelia.

00:14:56.300 --> 00:14:58.800
The enemy split up when they ran.

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:02.160
I think we need to send Gattarl team after them.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:13.700
That should do it. Have a seat!

00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:17.460
I just don't think the way you fought....

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:21.730
...was in line with your reputation for chivalry, Lieutenant Wattary Gilla.

00:15:22.130 --> 00:15:23.800
You have no right to say that.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:24.930
Stop that!

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:28.260
Don't act so conceited!

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:31.660
I can do what I like after a battle!

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:33.130
What did you do to her?!

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.400
Oh, you're one to talk.

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:38.160
Don't tell me you didn't plan on having fun...

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.800
...with this woman you captured, Lieutenant!

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.600
Just because you're the queen's little brother,

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.630
you act like you can do anything!

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:48.960
Brother?

00:15:50.530 --> 00:15:52.200
My sister has nothing to do with me!

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:54.930
You're the only one who thinks that!

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:00.660
We risked our lives, too!

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:05.060
And then you disrespect our commander, on top of that!

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:09.160
You brought the girl back to have fun with, didn't you?!

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:11.200
He isn't like that!

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:15.000
So, already seduced an Earth girl, huh?

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:19.660
Maybe I should just say that the ladies man here got killed at the resistance base!

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.730
Why, you!

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:31.830
I ask that you forgive my subordinate's rudeness.

00:16:32.460 --> 00:16:33.300
Lieutenant...

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:38.360
Please report to Captain Tassilo Wago at Keilas Guilie...

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:41.860
...that Wattary Gilla's team fought to the last unit.

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:47.630
Lieutenant... So, this is your code of chivalry?

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:52.100
Hardly. I have a few plans left.

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:55.100
In the end, chivalry is nothing but idealism.

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:03.260
Understand?

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:07.060
That wappa is probably headed for Largaine.

00:17:07.100 --> 00:17:11.060
Just find it. Don't chase after it too far.

00:17:11.100 --> 00:17:13.530
All clear? We rendezvous in two hours!

00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:15.260
Is that clear, Üso?

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:17.400
Understood, Mr. Romero.

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:22.060
Good grief...

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:24.130
It'll be all right, Mr. Romero.

00:17:24.430 --> 00:17:26.800
That kid will make it back to us.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:30.200
If he were careless, he wouldn't have fought like that today.

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:34.200
Yeah. The count sees his talent, as well.

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:01.260
The one from before.

00:18:26.830 --> 00:18:28.200
Did he eject?

00:18:31.700 --> 00:18:32.460
What?

00:18:46.760 --> 00:18:48.330
Where's he coming from?

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.160
Where?

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:13.630
With my own hands, I killed both my men and my pride as a soldier!

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:18.430
Gundam! Take your accursed name down to hell!

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:24.630
What?!

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.400
That's not a name that should be standing before us!

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:29.160
Who is this guy?!

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:41.100
Die!

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:44.100
The right arm beam shield's damaged!

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:48.960
He's gonna kill me!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.700
You won't escape!

00:19:58.930 --> 00:20:02.200
My vulcans! My rifle! My sabers!

00:20:05.230 --> 00:20:06.760
It's over!

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:13.100
What?!

00:20:15.660 --> 00:20:16.830
No way in hell I'm letting you go!

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:32.460
You?

00:20:32.930 --> 00:20:35.960
You're the pilot of the white mobile suit?!

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.100
So what if I am?

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.300
You attacked, so I had to...

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:43.530
This is real?

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.830
Can this actually be?

00:20:53.930 --> 00:20:56.600
A child, still young enough to play...

00:20:57.300 --> 00:21:01.230
He did this? In a place like this?! No!

00:21:03.600 --> 00:21:07.230
Children shouldn't be fighting in wars...

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.800
If this is what the world has come to...

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.130
Then everything's gone mad!

00:21:14.730 --> 00:21:18.500
Get out of that mobile suit before you're as mad as the rest!

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:21.060
I'm not doing it because I want to!

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:25.600
Is reality so cruel?

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:31.500
Get away! Get away from me!

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:34.100
Hurry! Go!

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:38.560
Damn it all.

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:05.000
Why?

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:06.960
Why?!

00:22:24.060 --> 00:22:29.530
Piercing the sky, Blue lightning
sora wo tsukisasu aoi inazuma

00:22:29.530 --> 00:22:35.320
Staining the earth, With the shadow of greed
daichi o someteku, yokubou no kage

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:41.460
Once again, when the nightmare, Envelops the Earth
futatabi akumu ga, sekai wo tsutsumu toki

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:46.790
You hear voices crying out "S.O.S."
"SOS" wo sakebu koe ga kikoeru...

00:22:48.630 --> 00:22:54.130
Let proud hope fill your heart
hokoritakaki kibou wo mune ni

00:22:54.720 --> 00:23:03.100
And stand up! Say a prayer for peace!!
tachiagare! heiwa no inori komete!

00:23:04.100 --> 00:23:05.100
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:06.100 --> 00:23:08.980
In every age
itsuno jidai mo

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:14.570
...People take risks for freedom
hito wa jiyuu wo kakete

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:17.000
WINNERS FOREVER!

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.240
The battle goes on
tatakai tsuzukeru

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:25.920
Fighting all alone in solitude
kodoku na made ni hitori...

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:36.800
The sound of motorcycles chills the soul, and the Camion is attacked.

00:23:37.230 --> 00:23:38.930
There's nothing I can do.

00:23:40.260 --> 00:23:43.430
Even as I hope Üso will leave the Camion,

